                .NET API backend. Features JWT auth, family/pet records, and a clean clinical workflow.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="project-arrow">&#x2197;</div>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="project-card fade-up">
            <div class="project-card-bg"></div>
            <div class="project-card-content">
                <p class="project-cat">Cloud Architecture</p>
