                <p class="project-desc">Hands-on infrastructure experiments: serverless functions, S3 static hosting,
                IAM policy design, and VPC networking as practical study alongside cloud cert prep.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="project-arrow">&#x2197;</div>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="project-card fade-up">
